 dnl = GObject Introspection ===================================================
-
+dnl The upstream macro lives in gobject-introspection's m4 dir, which is not
+dnl part of this tarball; introspection/vapi are disabled for this port (the
+dnl cross build cannot run g-ir-scanner against target binaries). Stub the
+dnl macro only when the real one is absent.
+m4_ifdef([GOBJECT_INTROSPECTION_CHECK], [],
+  [m4_define([GOBJECT_INTROSPECTION_CHECK],
+    [AC_ARG_ENABLE([introspection],
+       [AS_HELP_STRING([--enable-introspection],
+                       [Build introspection data (stubbed no-op on OHOS)])],
+       [], [enable_introspection=no])
+     AM_CONDITIONAL([HAVE_INTROSPECTION], [false])])])
 GOBJECT_INTROSPECTION_CHECK([0.6.7])
 
